<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer matches played midweek:</p>
<p>Played Thursday:</p>
<p>PSV Eindhoven 4 (Nilis 38th, 41st and 61st minutes, Eykelkamp</p>
<p>59th) RKC Waalwijk 0. Halftime 2-0. Attendance 26,500</p>
<p>Played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>AZ Alkmaar 2 (Mutsaers 53rd, Durmusoglu 75th) Volendam 1 (Valk</p>
<p>49th). 0-0. 7,080.</p>
<p>Graafschap Doetinchem 4 (Fuchs 21st, Viscaal 32nd, Godee 34th</p>
<p>and 64th) NEC Nijmegen 0. 3-0. 7,400.</p>
<p>Roda JC Kerkrade 0 Ajax Amsterdam 0. 10,000.</p>
<p>Sparta Rotterdam 1 (Krijgsman 72nd) Twente Enschede 2 (Bosman</p>
<p>41st, Ten Caat 51st). 0-1. 3,000.</p>
<p>Willem II Tilburg 2 (De Gier 53rd, Kolkka 70th) Vitesse Arnhem</p>
<p>1 (Van den Brom 80th). 0-0. 6,225.</p>
<p>Played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Fortuna Sittard 0 Feyenoord Rotterdam 2 (Larson 6th, Koeman</p>
<p>26th, penalty). 0-2. 7,000.</p>
<p>Heerenveen 0 NAC Breda 1 (Arnold 75th). 0-0. 13,000.</p>
<p>Utrecht 0 Groningen 0. 8,500.</p>
